<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Mangalore cargoes - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule</p>
