<p>  Commodity	     Tons		   Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		    (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Cement		1,160 (ULD)  1,420    Oscar Sirius    03/11</p>
<p> Timber		  492 (ULD)  1,092    Myomaywa	  28/11</p>
<p> Timber		1,385 (ULD)    ---    Magway	    05/12</p>
<p>Iron Ore</p>
<p>  Pellets	   15,000 (LDD) 18,000    You Chang	 04/12</p>
<p> Molasses	    6,500 (LDD)    500    K.Uralskiy	03/12</p>
<p>Natural</p>
<p> Gas Liquid	 15,000 (ULD)    ---    Jag Palak	 05/12</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>ULD-Discharge</p>
<p>LDD-Loading</p>
